00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:29.980
we could hire an army and a hundred battle crew.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.340
What you mean, from outside the Alliance?

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:33.180
Of course!

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.620
Antony's ships, mercenaries from Schlange.

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:39.500
Why, it might not even be necessary to sell the Jethric.

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:40.880
We could trade with them directly.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:43.420
Oh, dangerous if it came to the ears of the Alliance.

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:45.660
The time saved will be worth the risk.

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:07.990
Do I teach you anything about locks at the academy?

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:09.460
No, of course not.

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:11.540
Sonic screwdriver, you'll like this.

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:12.960
Keep an eye on the sentry.

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:13.380
Why?

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.440
Sleeping on duty is a serious offense.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:16.680
If anyone comes, you can wake him up.

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:19.280
You do know that sarcasm's an adjusted stress reaction.

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:24.490
Very impressive.

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:34.160
Ceremonial regalia? Sacred relics?

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:35.820
Must be the state strong room.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:38.710
Magnificent jewellery!

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:42.060
Never mind that. Just find the segment. It'll be daylight soon.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:45.200
There's something in here!

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:49.160
Get out of here before the locals wake up.

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:02.530
A top of the morning to you, my friend.

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:08.660
It's taking so long.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:11.400
Because they're multilevered interlocks.

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:12.920
Well, get on with it, then.

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:24.630
I just better finish it off.

00:22:25.590 --> 00:22:29.970
I need more of that stuff, and I'll not be able to blow the shriven, shrivenzali.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:57.680
in for its feet. Here, let me give you a hand. Thanks. Is the beast waiting there already? I'd see. My eyes.
